		<content type="html" xml:base="http://localhost/opengd77/viewtopic.php?t=4589&amp;p=34101#p34101"><![CDATA[
First of all to check you are using the correct firmware test the radio on an FM simplex channel and make sure it receives and transmits. If it does then you are using the correct firmware. If it doesn't then try another version. <br><br>Regarding the talkgroup selection,  that is probably a codeplug error or a misunderstanding of the way the firmware works. OpenGD77 normally uses one channel per repeater, selected with the knob. The talkgroup is then selected separately using the up and down buttons. <br><br>We would need to see a copy of your code plug to confirm this. <br><br><br>Colin G4EML<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=87">G4EML</a> — Fri Nov 15, 2024 6:39 pm</p><hr />
]]></content>
